{"id":"286b4fb3f5242f4f","group":"18","path":"18/18-df-infinitary-language.md","title":"可数分支语言 Lκ 与数变量模板","display":"df-infinitary-language — 可数分支语言 Lκ 与数变量模板","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-df-infinitary-language","aliases":["18-df-infinitary-language"],"display":"df-infinitary-language — 可数分支语言 Lκ 与数变量模板","depends_on":["[[18-df-arithmetic-tait-language]]"],"source_edition":"Pohlers 2009, Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity","source_section":"Definition 8.1.1; §8.3 (numerical templates as a coding supplement)","source_pages":"131–132,135–136","source_pdf_pages":"141–142,145–146","verification_status":"source-definition-and-local-construction-checked","source_correspondence":"tagged well-founded reconstruction for κ≤ω₁; open numerical templates are supplementary"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-df-infinitary-language"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-df-infinitary-language</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-infinitary-language — 可数分支语言 Lκ 与数变量模板"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7ddb1b71680edcd2\" href=\"?note=7ddb1b71680edcd2\" title=\"18-df-arithmetic-tait-language\">18-df-arithmetic-tait-language</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Pohlers 2009, Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity"},{"key":"source_section","html":"Definition 8.1.1; §8.3 (numerical templates as a coding supplement)"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"131–132,135–136"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"141–142,145–146"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-definition-and-local-construction-checked"},{"key":"source_correspondence","html":"tagged well-founded reconstruction for κ≤ω₁; open numerical templates are supplementary"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_1\">\\(\\omega_1\\)</span> 是最小不可数序数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\\leq\\kappa\\leq\\omega_1\">\\(0\\leq\\kappa\\leq\\omega_1\\)</span>。算术原子公式集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_{\\mathrm{NT}}\">\\(A_{\\mathrm{NT}}\\)</span>、数变量集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal V\\)</span>、集变量集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal X\">\\(\\mathcal X\\)</span> 及原子的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}_0,\\mathrm{FV}_1\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}_0,\\mathrm{FV}_1\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7ddb1b71680edcd2\" href=\"?note=7ddb1b71680edcd2\" title=\"18-df-arithmetic-tait-language\">18-df-arithmetic-tait-language</a>。有序对使用通常的集合编码。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec F:\\lambda\\to E\">\\(\\vec F:\\lambda\\to E\\)</span> 表示以序数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span> 为定义域的序列，允许 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda=0\">\\(\\lambda=0\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>本节先构造带自由数变量的原始模板集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U_\\kappa\">\\(\\mathcal U_\\kappa\\)</span>，再取有限支持模板 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_\\kappa^{\\mathrm{op}}\">\\(\\mathcal L_\\kappa^{\\mathrm{op}}\\)</span> 和无自由数变量的原书语言 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_\\kappa\">\\(\\mathcal L_\\kappa\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf a,\\mathsf C_\\lambda,\\mathsf D_\\lambda\">\\(\\mathsf a,\\mathsf C_\\lambda,\\mathsf D_\\lambda\\)</span> 是下式实际定义的互斥构造子。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}^{\\infty}_i\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}^{\\infty}_i\\)</span> 按带标签的良基构造递归，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in\\{0,1\\}\">\\(i\\in\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta\">\\(\\delta\\)</span> 在非零极限序数中取值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf a(A)\\coloneqq\\langle0,A\\rangle,\\qquad\n\\mathsf C_\\lambda(\\vec F)\\coloneqq\\langle1,\\langle\\lambda,\\vec F\\rangle\\rangle,\\qquad\n\\mathsf D_\\lambda(\\vec F)\\coloneqq\\langle2,\\langle\\lambda,\\vec F\\rangle\\rangle.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf a(A)\\coloneqq\\langle0,A\\rangle,\\qquad\n\\mathsf C_\\lambda(\\vec F)\\coloneqq\\langle1,\\langle\\lambda,\\vec F\\rangle\\rangle,\\qquad\n\\mathsf D_\\lambda(\\vec F)\\coloneqq\\langle2,\\langle\\lambda,\\vec F\\rangle\\rangle.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal U_\\kappa^0&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\mathsf a(A)\\mid A\\in A_{\\mathrm{NT}}\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal U_\\kappa^{\\alpha+1}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathcal U_\\kappa^\\alpha\\cup\n\\{\\mathsf C_\\lambda(\\vec F),\\mathsf D_\\lambda(\\vec F)\\mid\n\\lambda&lt;\\kappa,\\ \\vec F:\\lambda\\to\\mathcal U_\\kappa^\\alpha\\}\n\\qquad(\\alpha&lt;\\omega_1),\\\\\n\\mathcal U_\\kappa^\\delta&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{\\alpha&lt;\\delta}\\mathcal U_\\kappa^\\alpha\n\\qquad(0&lt;\\delta&lt;\\omega_1,\\ \\forall\\alpha&lt;\\delta\\ (\\alpha+1&lt;\\delta)),\\\\\n\\mathcal U_\\kappa&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{\\alpha&lt;\\omega_1}\\mathcal U_\\kappa^\\alpha.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal U_\\kappa^0&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\mathsf a(A)\\mid A\\in A_{\\mathrm{NT}}\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal U_\\kappa^{\\alpha+1}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathcal U_\\kappa^\\alpha\\cup\n\\{\\mathsf C_\\lambda(\\vec F),\\mathsf D_\\lambda(\\vec F)\\mid\n\\lambda&lt;\\kappa,\\ \\vec F:\\lambda\\to\\mathcal U_\\kappa^\\alpha\\}\n\\qquad(\\alpha&lt;\\omega_1),\\\\\n\\mathcal U_\\kappa^\\delta&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{\\alpha&lt;\\delta}\\mathcal U_\\kappa^\\alpha\n\\qquad(0&lt;\\delta&lt;\\omega_1,\\ \\forall\\alpha&lt;\\delta\\ (\\alpha+1&lt;\\delta)),\\\\\n\\mathcal U_\\kappa&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{\\alpha&lt;\\omega_1}\\mathcal U_\\kappa^\\alpha.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{FV}^{\\infty}_i(\\mathsf a(A))&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}_i(A),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}^{\\infty}_i(\\mathsf C_\\lambda(\\vec F))&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\bigcup_{\\xi&lt;\\lambda}\\mathrm{FV}^{\\infty}_i(F_\\xi),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}^{\\infty}_i(\\mathsf D_\\lambda(\\vec F))&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\bigcup_{\\xi&lt;\\lambda}\\mathrm{FV}^{\\infty}_i(F_\\xi),\\\\\n\\mathcal L_\\kappa^{\\mathrm{op}}&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{F\\in\\mathcal U_\\kappa\\mid\n|\\mathrm{FV}^{\\infty}_0(F)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}^{\\infty}_1(F)|&lt;\\omega\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal L_\\kappa&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{F\\in\\mathcal L_\\kappa^{\\mathrm{op}}\\mid\\mathrm{FV}^{\\infty}_0(F)=\\varnothing\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{FV}^{\\infty}_i(\\mathsf a(A))&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}_i(A),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}^{\\infty}_i(\\mathsf C_\\lambda(\\vec F))&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\bigcup_{\\xi&lt;\\lambda}\\mathrm{FV}^{\\infty}_i(F_\\xi),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}^{\\infty}_i(\\mathsf D_\\lambda(\\vec F))&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\bigcup_{\\xi&lt;\\lambda}\\mathrm{FV}^{\\infty}_i(F_\\xi),\\\\\n\\mathcal L_\\kappa^{\\mathrm{op}}&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{F\\in\\mathcal U_\\kappa\\mid\n|\\mathrm{FV}^{\\infty}_0(F)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}^{\\infty}_1(F)|&lt;\\omega\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal L_\\kappa&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{F\\in\\mathcal L_\\kappa^{\\mathrm{op}}\\mid\\mathrm{FV}^{\\infty}_0(F)=\\varnothing\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应 Definition 8.1.1 的可数分支部分。标签 0、1、2 分别区分原子、合取、析取；序列的定义域和重复项均保留。空合取和空析取是不同的合法构造，不与数值原子混同。原书只取闭数项；本地开放模板用于精确表达 §8.3 的二数变量关系定义，不把它们称为原书的闭公式。</p>\n<p>各阶段由超限递归形成集合。每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda&lt;\\kappa\\leq\\omega_1\">\\(\\lambda&lt;\\kappa\\leq\\omega_1\\)</span> 可数，故任何可数列的阶段指标在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_1\">\\(\\omega_1\\)</span> 以下有共同上界，最终并集对所需构造封闭。子公式代码的集合秩严格下降，给出 FV 的良基递归；末端有限支持限制蕴含每个子公式也有有限支持。因此闭合部分恰好满足原书“全部自由集参数的并有限”的生成条件，而非只有逐个分支分别有限。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa&gt;\\omega_1\">\\(\\kappa&gt;\\omega_1\\)</span> 的语言不在本节点范围。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-arithmetic-tait-language","status":"resolved","id":"7ddb1b71680edcd2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-arithmetic-tait-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-arithmetic-tait-language","status":"resolved","id":"7ddb1b71680edcd2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\omega_1$ 是最小不可数序数，$0\\leq\\kappa\\leq\\omega_1$。算术原子公式集 $A_{\\mathrm{NT}}$、数变量集 $\\mathcal V$、集变量集 $\\mathcal X$ 及原子的 $\\mathrm{FV}_0,\\mathrm{FV}_1$ 取 [[18-df-arithmetic-tait-language]]。有序对使用通常的集合编码。$\\vec F:\\lambda\\to E$ 表示以序数 $\\lambda$ 为定义域的序列，允许 $\\lambda=0$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\omega_1","display":false},{"tex":"0\\leq\\kappa\\leq\\omega_1","display":false},{"tex":"A_{\\mathrm{NT}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FV}_0,\\mathrm{FV}_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec F:\\lambda\\to E","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda=0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal U_\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_\\kappa^{\\mathrm{op}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf a,\\mathsf C_\\lambda,\\mathsf D_\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FV}^{\\infty}_i","display":false},{"tex":"i\\in\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\delta","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf a(A)\\coloneqq\\langle0,A\\rangle,\\qquad\n\\mathsf C_\\lambda(\\vec F)\\coloneqq\\langle1,\\langle\\lambda,\\vec F\\rangle\\rangle,\\qquad\n\\mathsf D_\\lambda(\\vec F)\\coloneqq\\langle2,\\langle\\lambda,\\vec F\\rangle\\rangle.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal U_\\kappa^0&\\coloneqq\\{\\mathsf a(A)\\mid A\\in A_{\\mathrm{NT}}\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal U_\\kappa^{\\alpha+1}&\\coloneqq\\mathcal U_\\kappa^\\alpha\\cup\n\\{\\mathsf C_\\lambda(\\vec F),\\mathsf D_\\lambda(\\vec F)\\mid\n\\lambda<\\kappa,\\ \\vec F:\\lambda\\to\\mathcal U_\\kappa^\\alpha\\}\n\\qquad(\\alpha<\\omega_1),\\\\\n\\mathcal U_\\kappa^\\delta&\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{\\alpha<\\delta}\\mathcal U_\\kappa^\\alpha\n\\qquad(0<\\delta<\\omega_1,\\ \\forall\\alpha<\\delta\\ (\\alpha+1<\\delta)),\\\\\n\\mathcal U_\\kappa&\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{\\alpha<\\omega_1}\\mathcal U_\\kappa^\\alpha.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{FV}^{\\infty}_i(\\mathsf a(A))&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}_i(A),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}^{\\infty}_i(\\mathsf C_\\lambda(\\vec F))&\\coloneqq\n\\bigcup_{\\xi<\\lambda}\\mathrm{FV}^{\\infty}_i(F_\\xi),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}^{\\infty}_i(\\mathsf D_\\lambda(\\vec F))&\\coloneqq\n\\bigcup_{\\xi<\\lambda}\\mathrm{FV}^{\\infty}_i(F_\\xi),\\\\\n\\mathcal L_\\kappa^{\\mathrm{op}}&\\coloneqq\n\\{F\\in\\mathcal U_\\kappa\\mid\n|\\mathrm{FV}^{\\infty}_0(F)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}^{\\infty}_1(F)|<\\omega\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal L_\\kappa&\\coloneqq\n\\{F\\in\\mathcal L_\\kappa^{\\mathrm{op}}\\mid\\mathrm{FV}^{\\infty}_0(F)=\\varnothing\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\lambda<\\kappa\\leq\\omega_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa>\\omega_1","display":false}],"bytes":3847,"backlinks":[{"id":"392bd14777be34cd","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$0\\leq\\kappa\\leq\\omega_1$，$\\mathcal U_\\kappa,\\mathcal L_\\kappa^{\\mathrm{op}},\\mathcal L_\\kappa$ 及其带标签构造子见 [[18-df-infinitary-language]]。算术原子的对偶 $\\sim_{\\mathrm N}$、闭项集 $\\mathrm{CT}_{\\mathrm{NT}}$、闭项值 $\\operatorname{val}$ 和数项代入见 [[18-df-arithmetic-tait-language]]。$A\\in A_{\\mathrm{NT}}$，$x\\in\\mathcal V$，$t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{\\mathrm{NT}}$。"},{"id":"e40f6292323bbb0b","anchor":"ref-111","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./18-df-infinitary-language]]"},{"id":"100d7af02276fe1b","anchor":"ref-77","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-infinitary-language]]"},{"id":"e29d1100705cdb23","anchor":"ref-48","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-infinitary-language]]"},{"id":"bf01645e59119446","anchor":"ref-45","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-infinitary-language|18-df-infinitary-language]]"}],"outgoing":["7ddb1b71680edcd2"]}